{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should have been a routine police operation quickly escalates into a nightmare for officer Jason Thompson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>It Reaches</strong>, a first-person horror game seen through the lens of Jason's body cam. Explore the abandoned hospital and its underground facilities, find clues, solve puzzles and escape deadly encounters. Stay alert as you uncover the dark mystery behind the horror that follows you, for it never stops\u2026 it reaches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate through the lens of a body cam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way out! Examine your surroundings and collect helpful clues and information left behind in the abandoned complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/47b6052ae9b947ae1df195c8f354002e.poster.avif?t=1761223428\" width=720 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/47b6052ae9b947ae1df195c8f354002e.webm?t=1761223428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/47b6052ae9b947ae1df195c8f354002e.mp4?t=1761223428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the\u00a0treacherous facilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through traps and puzzles and uncover the truth behind the terrors lurking in the murky hallways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/ee734c1b44203838e56653d8ecc2ac92.poster.avif?t=1761223428\" width=720 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/ee734c1b44203838e56653d8ecc2ac92.webm?t=1761223428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/ee734c1b44203838e56653d8ecc2ac92.mp4?t=1761223428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don\u2019t Get Caught: It reaches for you!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake could be the end! Survive various encounters by using the environment to your advantage. Stay unseen to overcome the seemingly overwhelming enemy out there looking for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/6e23ddc61cfd201cdc7b57755914c285.poster.avif?t=1761223428\" width=720 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/6e23ddc61cfd201cdc7b57755914c285.webm?t=1761223428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/6e23ddc61cfd201cdc7b57755914c285.mp4?t=1761223428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight back and Survive!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and manage limited resources to defend yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/9624dcb8c4437208a5e75aa800ba654f.poster.avif?t=1761223428\" width=720 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/9624dcb8c4437208a5e75aa800ba654f.webm?t=1761223428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/extras/9624dcb8c4437208a5e75aa800ba654f.mp4?t=1761223428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Average Playtime:</strong>\u00a030 - 45 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo you will begin your experience right after you have been captured and locked away deep inside the former laboratories underground. Your goal is to escape the nightmare you\u2019ve been trapped in. The gameplay of this demo will feature a selection of puzzles to solve as well as mechanics to escape the otherwise deadly encounters you will be facing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119380?t=1761223428","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119380?t=1761223428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/f5f03c78c7fa1729c104a0910044353e294e377c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761223428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119380/f5f03c78c7fa1729c104a0910044353e294e377c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761223428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This demo includes content not appropriate for all ages. This includes disturbing imagery, depictions of blood, severed limbs, and dead bodies. Player discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What should have been a routine police operation quickly escalates into a nightmare for offi